{"seq":2,"slug":"sellability-rule-audit-trace","title":"准入判定留痕、审计与申诉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/matrix-rollout-audit/sellability-rule-audit-trace","wordCount":1991,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"准入判定留痕-审计与申诉\">准入判定留痕、审计与申诉</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>每次可售性判定都在产生一个<strong>需要被解释的结论</strong>。卖家想知道为什么不能卖，客服想知道该怎么回答，监管方想知道依据什么规则，而法务在争议发生时想知道当时到底用哪一版规则、基于哪些事实。如果判定只返回一个布尔值，这四类问题全部无法回答。留痕的目标就是把「一次判定」变成一条<strong>可复现的证据记录</strong>。</p>\n<p>可复现是留痕的判定标准，而不是「记了日志」。可复现要求记录四件事：<strong>输入事实、规则版本、求值时刻、判定输出</strong>。缺任何一项都无法重放：没有事实快照，重放时会读到新事实；没有规则版本，重放时会用新规则；没有求值时刻，无法确定当时哪些规则处于生效期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>留痕对象</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>保留期驱动</th>\n<th>查询入口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判定结果</td>\n<td>四态结论 + 层级 + 原因码 + 依据</td>\n<td>争议时效、法规要求</td>\n<td>商品/订单维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入事实</td>\n<td>事实键 + 值 + 取数来源 + 抓取时刻</td>\n<td>数据合规要求</td>\n<td>判定 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则快照</td>\n<td>命中的规则 ID + 版本 + 生效期</td>\n<td>法规保存年限（如符合性声明 10 年）</td>\n<td>版本维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质证据</td>\n<td>文件引用 + 核验状态 + 核验人</td>\n<td>资质有效期 + 保存年限</td>\n<td>卖家/商品维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时校验</td>\n<td>验龄方式与结果、配额预留号</td>\n<td>交易与合规要求</td>\n<td>订单维度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[求值引擎] --&gt; D[生成判定 ID]&#10;  D --&gt; W1[(判定结果表&lt;br/&gt;结论+原因码+依据)]&#10;  D --&gt; W2[(事实快照&lt;br/&gt;键值+来源+时刻)]&#10;  D --&gt; W3[(规则命中记录&lt;br/&gt;rule_id+version)]&#10;  W1 --&gt; Q1[卖家侧解释接口]&#10;  W1 --&gt; Q2[客服工单查询]&#10;  W3 --&gt; Q3[监管/审计导出]&#10;  W2 --&gt; Q3&#10;  W1 --&gt; A[申诉入口]&#10;  A --&gt; A1[复核: 事实是否准确]&#10;  A1 --&gt; A2[复核: 规则是否适用]&#10;  A2 --&gt; A3[裁定 + 回写]\">graph TD\n  E[求值引擎] --&gt; D[生成判定 ID]\n  D --&gt; W1[(判定结果表&lt;br/&gt;结论+原因码+依据)]\n  D --&gt; W2[(事实快照&lt;br/&gt;键值+来源+时刻)]\n  D --&gt; W3[(规则命中记录&lt;br/&gt;rule_id+version)]\n  W1 --&gt; Q1[卖家侧解释接口]\n  W1 --&gt; Q2[客服工单查询]\n  W3 --&gt; Q3[监管/审计导出]\n  W2 --&gt; Q3\n  W1 --&gt; A[申诉入口]\n  A --&gt; A1[复核: 事实是否准确]\n  A1 --&gt; A2[复核: 规则是否适用]\n  A2 --&gt; A3[裁定 + 回写]</pre><h2 id=\"判定记录的字段设计\">判定记录的字段设计</h2><p>留痕的记录结构决定了事后能回答什么问题，因此字段设计要在实现之前定好。以下是最小可用集合，其中每一个字段都对应一个具体的事后问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE sellability_decision (&#10;  decision_id    BIGINT       PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  decided_at     TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,&#10;  as_of          TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,   -- 判定所依据的时间语义&#10;  item_id        BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  market_code    VARCHAR(8)   NOT NULL,&#10;  fulfillment_channel VARCHAR(16),&#10;  gate           VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,   -- listing/checkout/inbound&#10;  outcome        VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  tier           VARCHAR(24),&#10;  reason_codes   JSONB        NOT NULL,   -- 枚举原因码数组&#10;  basis_refs     JSONB        NOT NULL,   -- 规则引用（法规条款/政策条目）&#10;  rule_version   VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,&#10;  hit_rule_ids   BIGINT[]     NOT NULL,&#10;  facts_digest   CHAR(64)     NOT NULL,   -- 事实快照的内容摘要&#10;  source_kind    VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,   -- statute | platform_policy | internal&#10;  latency_ms     INT,&#10;  request_id     VARCHAR(64),&#10;  actor          VARCHAR(64)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ix_decision_item_market&#10;  ON sellability_decision (item_id, market_code, decided_at DESC);&#10;CREATE INDEX ix_decision_version ON sellability_decision (rule_version, gate);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sellability_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  as_of          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定所依据的时间语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fulfillment_channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gate           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- listing/checkout/inbound</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_codes   JSONB        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 枚举原因码数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis_refs     JSONB        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 规则引用（法规条款/政策条目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hit_rule_ids   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  facts_digest   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事实快照的内容摘要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_kind    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- statute | platform_policy | internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  latency_ms     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ix_decision_item_market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sellability_decision (item_id, market_code, decided_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ix_decision_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sellability_decision (rule_version, gate);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得单独说明。<code>as_of</code> 与 <code>decided_at</code> 分开是必要的：补单重算时 <code>decided_at</code> 是现在，<code>as_of</code> 是原交易时刻，两者混用会让重算结果无法与原判定对齐。<code>hit_rule_ids</code> 记录<strong>所有</strong>命中的规则而不只是胜出者，因为误判复盘时经常需要回答「当时还有哪些规则本应命中但没命中」。<code>facts_digest</code> 用内容摘要而不是把全部事实内联，既控制了记录体积，又能通过比对摘要发现事实漂移。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事实快照的存法\">事实快照的存法</h3><p>事实快照不能只存摘要，否则无法还原。可行做法是分层：判定记录里存摘要与事实表的引用，事实本身按 <code>(事实键, 时刻)</code> 存成可追溯版本。事实表的关键设计是<strong>只追加不更新</strong>，每次事实变更产生一条新记录并带生效时刻，查询时按 <code>as_of</code> 取当时的值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE eligibility_fact_history (&#10;  fact_key    VARCHAR(160) NOT NULL,   -- item:90021:dg_class&#10;  valid_from  TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to    TIMESTAMPTZ,             -- NULL=当前有效&#10;  value       JSONB        NOT NULL,&#10;  source_ref  TEXT,                    -- 取数来源（系统/接口/人工录入）&#10;  fetched_at  TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (fact_key, valid_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> eligibility_fact_history</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fact_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- item:90021:dg_class</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL=当前有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       JSONB        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取数来源（系统/接口/人工录入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fetched_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fact_key, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按 <code>as_of</code> 取值的查询是 <code>valid_from &lt;= :as_of AND (valid_to IS NULL OR valid_to &gt; :as_of)</code>。这个结构让「当时事实是什么」变得可直接回答，而这是申诉复核里最常见的争点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计-从个体判定到规则证据链\">审计：从个体判定到规则证据链</h2><p>个体留痕回答「这一笔为什么这样判」，审计要回答的是「这条规则是怎么来的、影响了什么、是否仍然正确」。两者需要的数据不同，因此审计视图要从规则版本出发反向聚合。</p>\n<p>审计要能拉出一条完整链条：<strong>规则 ID → 来源引用（法规条款/官方公报）→ 抓取与归一化记录 → 复核人 → 生效区间 → 该区间内的判定数量与分布 → 涉及的卖家与商品</strong>。这条链上任何一环缺失，都会让「这批商品为什么被拦」变成无法回答的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 审计视图：某规则版本在其生效区间内的判定分布&#10;SELECT d.rule_version,&#10;       d.gate,&#10;       d.outcome,&#10;       COUNT(*)                            AS decisions,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT d.item_id)           AS items,&#10;       MIN(d.decided_at)                   AS first_seen,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE d.source_kind = &#39;statute&#39;) AS statute_based&#10;FROM sellability_decision d&#10;WHERE d.rule_version = :version&#10;  AND d.decided_at &gt;= :from AND d.decided_at &lt; :to&#10;GROUP BY GROUPING SETS ((d.rule_version, d.gate, d.outcome), (d.rule_version));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审计视图：某规则版本在其生效区间内的判定分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decisions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_seen,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'statute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statute_based</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sellability_decision d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUPING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SETS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>GROUPING SETS</code> 一次产出两层聚合，避免为「总计」再跑一次查询。<code>statute_based</code> 这一列用于区分拦截中有多少带法规依据——它直接决定申诉的回答口径与监管沟通的措辞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保留期与法规保存年限\">保留期与法规保存年限</h3><p>保留期不是统一值，它由几类约束叠加决定：法规要求（例如欧盟符合性声明与技术文件要求保留至少十年，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CE_marking\">CE marking</a>）、争议时效、以及数据最小化要求。可行的做法是按记录类型配置保留期，并且在到期时执行<strong>可验证的删除</strong>——删除必须覆盖派生副本（聚合表、导出文件、缓存），否则「已删除」不成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申诉-三类争点与对应证据\">申诉：三类争点与对应证据</h2><p>申诉的处理效率取决于能否快速归类争点。实务中几乎全部申诉落在三类之一，每类需要不同的证据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>争点</th>\n<th>典型主张</th>\n<th>需要调取的证据</th>\n<th>处理路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实错误</td>\n<td>分类编码/成分/容量申报有误</td>\n<td>事实快照 + 来源 + 商品主数据</td>\n<td>修正事实后重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则不适用</td>\n<td>该规则不覆盖我的商品/市场</td>\n<td><code>hit_rule_ids</code> + <code>basis_refs</code> + 规则原文</td>\n<td>规则评审，必要时改规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则过时</td>\n<td>法规已修订/已废止</td>\n<td>规则来源引用 + 抓取时间 + 版本血缘</td>\n<td>触发来源巡检与版本回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质已具备</td>\n<td>已上传但未核验</td>\n<td>资质证据 + 核验状态</td>\n<td>加速核验流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三类是唯一会<strong>反向修改规则</strong>的争点，因此它必须有独立的入口与统计：申诉中「规则过时」占比升高，是来源巡检周期设置不当的直接信号，与 <a href=\"../eligibility-condition-data/eligibility-source-freshness-version\">准入数据来源、时效与规则版本</a> 的复查周期是同一个闭环。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;appeal_id&quot;: &quot;AP-77120-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: 8814203,&#10;  &quot;claim_type&quot;: &quot;rule_outdated&quot;,&#10;  &quot;seller_evidence&quot;: [&quot;s3://seller/updates/gazette-2026-09.pdf&quot;],&#10;  &quot;reviewer&quot;: &quot;compliance-ops-3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_check&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;hit_rule_ids&quot;: [40218],&#10;    &quot;source_refs&quot;: [{ &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;official_gazette&quot;, &quot;ref&quot;: &quot;reg-2026-0912-a&quot;, &quot;fetched_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-13T02:11:00Z&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;source_superseded&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;resolution&quot;: &quot;rule_version_rollback_recommended&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decided_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-29T07:40:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"appeal_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AP-77120-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8814203</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"claim_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule_outdated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seller_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s3://seller/updates/gazette-2026-09.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"compliance-ops-3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hit_rule_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40218</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source_refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"official_gazette\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reg-2026-0912-a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fetched_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-13T02:11:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"source_superseded\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule_version_rollback_recommended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decided_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-29T07:40:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"申诉不能直接改判定\">申诉不能直接改判定</h3><p>一个必须坚持的原则：<strong>申诉流程不直接覆盖历史判定记录</strong>。历史记录是不可变的证据，修正只能通过「新增一条修正记录并指向原判定」来表达。直接改写历史会让审计链断裂，也会让「当时依据什么」变得不可回答。修正记录反过来成为重算的输入，驱动受影响商品的重新求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与隐私和最小化的平衡\">与隐私和最小化的平衡</h2><p>留痕与数据最小化存在天然张力。判定记录中不应包含不必要的个人数据：卖家侧事实（资质、分类）可以完整保留，买家侧信息（年龄验证结果）应只保留<strong>验证方式与结论</strong>，不保留证件影像或出生日期原文。运行时校验记录里保存「验龄通过 / 未通过 / 未执行」与验证渠道即可，这既能支撑合规举证，也不把留痕变成个人数据仓库。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可解释性与文案的一致性\">可解释性与文案的一致性</h3><p>留痕里的 <code>reason_codes</code> 与 <code>basis_refs</code> 应当<strong>直接驱动</strong>用户可见文案，而不是另写一套文案逻辑。两套并行的解释逻辑必然漂移，最终导致卖家收到的解释与系统记录的原因不一致——这在申诉与监管问询中是最难解释的一类问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>留痕的标准是可复现，而非「记了日志」：必须记录输入事实、规则版本、求值时刻、判定输出四件事。</li>\n<li><code>as_of</code> 与 <code>decided_at</code> 必须分开，否则补单重算无法与原判定对齐；<code>hit_rule_ids</code> 要记全部命中而不仅胜出者。</li>\n<li>事实快照只追加不更新，按 <code>as_of</code> 取值，才能回答「当时事实是什么」。</li>\n<li>审计要从规则版本反向聚合出证据链：规则 → 来源引用 → 归一化 → 复核 → 生效区间 → 判定分布。</li>\n<li>保留期按记录类型配置（法规保存年限、争议时效、最小化要求），删除必须覆盖派生副本。</li>\n<li>申诉归为四类争点；「规则过时」类会反向修改规则，其占比升高是来源巡检周期的信号。</li>\n<li>申诉不得覆盖历史判定，只能新增修正记录并指向原判定。</li>\n<li>留痕中买家侧只保留验证方式与结论；<code>reason_codes</code>/<code>basis_refs</code> 应直接驱动用户可见文案，避免两套解释逻辑漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"准入判定留痕、审计与申诉","id":"准入判定留痕-审计与申诉"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"判定记录的字段设计","id":"判定记录的字段设计"},{"level":3,"text":"事实快照的存法","id":"事实快照的存法"},{"level":2,"text":"审计：从个体判定到规则证据链","id":"审计-从个体判定到规则证据链"},{"level":3,"text":"保留期与法规保存年限","id":"保留期与法规保存年限"},{"level":2,"text":"申诉：三类争点与对应证据","id":"申诉-三类争点与对应证据"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉不能直接改判定","id":"申诉不能直接改判定"},{"level":2,"text":"与隐私和最小化的平衡","id":"与隐私和最小化的平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"可解释性与文案的一致性","id":"可解释性与文案的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"市场开关与分批灰度放量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/matrix-rollout-audit/market-switch-phased-rollout"},"next":{"title":"可售性覆盖率/误拦/漏放度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/matrix-rollout-audit/eligibility-coverage-gap-metric"}}